# Testing

When editing `src/domain/` pack, trade, or cooldown logic:

- Add/update Jest tests in same PR logical unit
- Cover happy path + edge (pool too small, expired trade)
- Do not add snapshot tests for atoms in MVP

See `docs/TESTING.md` and `docs/PHASES/04-packs.md`, `05-trading.md`.
